-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/814876753_122118956265436635_10724491960696848_n-1-1024x761.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/cornerstone-residential.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/814876753_122118956265436635_10724491960696848_n-1-768x571.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1179px) 100vw, 1179px\">\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-text gb-text-432df6f7\">Residential Foundations<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div>\n<p class=\"gb-text gb-text-c21f6efa\">Slab and conventional foundations built right, with the forms, rebar, and finished concrete your project needs.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-element-df7143be\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1179\" height=\"873\" class=\"gb-media-9a08ce36\" alt=\"\" title=\"795557667_122118956091436635_746469807290941243_n 1\" src=\"http:\/\/cornerstone-residential.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/795557667_122118956091436635_746469807290941243_n-1.jpg\" srcset=\"http:\/\/cornerstone-residential.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/795557667_122118956091436635_746469807290941243_n-1.jpg 1179w, http:\/\/cornerstone-residential.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/795557667_122118956091436635_746469807290941243_n-1-300x222.jpg 300w, http:\/\/cornerstone-residential.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/795557667_122118956091436635_746469807290941243_n-1-1024x758.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/cornerstone-residential.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/795557667_122118956091436635_746469807290941243_n-1-768x569.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1179px) 100vw, 1179px\">\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-text gb-text-a99ede1f\">Site Work &amp; Excavation<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"gb-text gb-text-3ff47c31\">From excavation and site prep to drainage solutions, we get your property ready for whatever comes next.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-element-8c84fb78\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1179\" height=\"876\" class=\"gb-media-45b16022\" alt=\"\" title=\"814876740_122118956247436635_6444243369650600333_n 1\" src=\"http:\/\/cor